# GraphCalendar

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphCalendar } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphCalendar
  title="example"
  year={0}
  month={0}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphCalendar
  title="example"
  year={0}
  month={0}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `year` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `month` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `weekStartsOn?` | `0 | 1` | `1` | — |
| `marks?` | `CalendarMark[] | number[]` | `—` | — |
| `today?` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `CalendarMark`
- `GraphCalendarProps`
